OL,3,GNEWSA'Dad was deteriorating': Two-hour 
OL,4,Aambulance target missed more than 2,000
OL,5,Atimes                                  
OL,7,FWhen 85-year-old William Murphy became 
OL,8,Fseriously ill at his home in September,
OL,9,Fhis family expected help to arrive     
OL,10,Fquickly.                               
OL,12,FInstead, they waited more than 12 hours
OL,13,Ffor an ambulance, despite a new        
OL,14,Finitiative - the Release to Rescue     
OL,15,Fscheme - designed to free up crews to  
OL,16,Frespond to calls more quickly.         
OL,18,F"Dad was deteriorating... he couldn't  
OL,19,Fwalk," his son Ronnie recalled. By the 
OL,20,Ftime William reached hospital, he      
OL,21,Fneeded oxygen as his levels were       
OL,22,Fseverely low.                          
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
