OL,3,GNEWSA'Dad was deteriorating': Two-hour 
OL,4,Aambulance target missed more than 2,000
OL,5,Atimes                                  
OL,7,FWilliam's experience was not an        
OL,8,Fisolated case in Northern Ireland,     
OL,9,Fwhere patients facing lengthy waits for
OL,10,Fan ambulance are not uncommon.         
